																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"677387230220655033","clan_steamid":"103582791475851404","event_name":"The SLAM TANK Demo Is Staying for Two More Weeks!","event_type":28,"appid":5186030,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1793032200,"rtime32_end_time":1793037600,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Available until November 9, 2026 at 17:00 UTC. The cape reward event continues!\",\"Spielbar bis 9. November 2026, 17:00 Uhr (UTC). Die Umhang-Belohnungsaktion l\u00e4uft weiter!\",\"Jusqu'au 9 novembre 2026 \u00e0 17 h 00 (UTC). L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement de la cape continue !\",null,\"2026\ub144 11\uc6d4 10\uc77c \uc624\uc804 2\uc2dc(\ud55c\uad6d\uc2dc\uac04)\uae4c\uc9c0 \ud50c\ub808\uc774 \uac00\ub2a5! \ub9dd\ud1a0 \ubcf4\uc0c1 \uc774\ubca4\ud2b8\ub3c4 \uacc4\uc18d\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"Disponible hasta el 9 de noviembre de 2026, 17:00 UTC. \u00a1El evento de la capa contin\u00faa!\",\"\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u5f00\u653e\u81f32026\u5e7411\u67089\u65e517:00\uff08UTC\uff09\uff0c\u62ab\u98ce\u5956\u52b1\u6d3b\u52a8\u4e5f\u5c06\u7ee7\u7eed\uff01\",\"\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u958b\u653e\u81f32026\u5e7411\u67089\u65e517:00\uff08UTC\uff09\uff0c\u62ab\u98a8\u734e\u52f5\u6d3b\u52d5\u4e5f\u6703\u7e7c\u7e8c\uff01\",\"\u0414\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0434\u043e 9 \u043d\u043e\u044f\u0431\u0440\u044f 2026 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430, 17:00 UTC. \u0410\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0441 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449\u043e\u043c \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f!\",null,\"2026\u5e7411\u67089\u65e517:00\uff08UTC\uff09\u307e\u3067\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u53ef\u80fd\uff01\u30de\u30f3\u30c8\u5831\u916c\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u3082\u7d99\u7d9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Dispon\u00edvel at\u00e9 9 de novembro de 2026, \u00e0s 17h UTC. O evento da capa continua!\",null,null,null,\"\u0414\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0434\u043e 9 \u043b\u0438\u0441\u0442\u043e\u043f\u0430\u0434\u0430 2026 \u0440\u043e\u043a\u0443, 17:00 UTC. \u0410\u043a\u0446\u0456\u044f \u0437 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043c \u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0454!\",null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"The demo will stay available for two weeks after Steam Next Fest. We'll keep improving and testing based on your feedback, and the cape reward event will continue too.\",\"Die Demo bleibt nach dem Steam Next Fest zwei weitere Wochen verf\u00fcgbar. Wir verbessern und testen weiter anhand eures Feedbacks. Auch die Umhang-Belohnungsaktion l\u00e4uft weiter.\",\"Deux semaines de plus pour jouer apr\u00e8s le Steam Next Fest ! Nous poursuivons les am\u00e9liorations et les tests gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 vos retours. L'\u00e9v\u00e9nement de la cape continue.\",null,\"Steam \ub125\uc2a4\ud2b8 \ud398\uc2a4\ud2b8 \uc885\ub8cc \ud6c4\uc5d0\ub3c4 \ub370\ubaa8\ub97c 2\uc8fc \ub354 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud558\uc2e4 \uc218 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \ubcf4\ub0b4\uc8fc\uc2e0 \ud53c\ub4dc\ubc31\uc744 \ubc14\ud0d5\uc73c\ub85c \uac1c\uc120\uacfc \ud14c\uc2a4\ud2b8\ub97c \uc774\uc5b4\uac00\uba70, \ub9dd\ud1a0 \ubcf4\uc0c1 \uc774\ubca4\ud2b8\ub3c4 \uacc4\uc18d\ub429\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"La demo seguir\u00e1 disponible dos semanas tras Steam Next Fest. Seguiremos mejor\u00e1ndola y haciendo pruebas con vuestros comentarios. \u00a1El evento de la capa tambi\u00e9n contin\u00faa!\",\"Steam\u65b0\u54c1\u8282\u7ed3\u675f\u540e\uff0c\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u5c06\u7ee7\u7eed\u5f00\u653e\u4e24\u5468\u3002\u6211\u4eec\u4f1a\u6839\u636e\u5927\u5bb6\u7684\u53cd\u9988\u7ee7\u7eed\u6539\u8fdb\u548c\u6d4b\u8bd5\uff0c\u62ab\u98ce\u5956\u52b1\u6d3b\u52a8\u4e5f\u5c06\u7ee7\u7eed\uff01\",\"Steam\u65b0\u54c1\u7bc0\u7d50\u675f\u5f8c\uff0c\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u5c07\u7e7c\u7e8c\u958b\u653e\u5169\u9031\u3002\u6211\u5011\u6703\u6839\u64da\u5927\u5bb6\u7684\u56de\u994b\u6301\u7e8c\u6539\u9032\u8207\u6e2c\u8a66\uff0c\u62ab\u98a8\u734e\u52f5\u6d3b\u52d5\u4e5f\u6703\u7e7c\u7e8c\uff01\",\"\u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0438\u044f \u043e\u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u0434\u0432\u0435 \u043d\u0435\u0434\u0435\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u043b\u0435 Steam Next Fest. \u041c\u044b \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0438\u043c \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0441 \u0443\u0447\u0451\u0442\u043e\u043c \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u043e\u0442\u0437\u044b\u0432\u043e\u0432. \u0410\u043a\u0446\u0438\u044f \u0441 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449\u043e\u043c \u0442\u043e\u0436\u0435 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u043b\u0436\u0430\u0435\u0442\u0441\u044f!\",null,\"Steam Next Fest\u7d42\u4e86\u5f8c\u3082\u3001\u30c7\u30e2\u3092\u3055\u3089\u306b2\u9031\u9593\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u7686\u3055\u3093\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u3082\u3068\u306b\u6539\u5584\u3068\u30c6\u30b9\u30c8\u3092\u7d9a\u3051\u3001\u30de\u30f3\u30c8\u5831\u916c\u30a4\u30d9\u30f3\u30c8\u3082\u7d99\u7d9a\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"A demo continuar\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel por duas semanas ap\u00f3s o Steam Next Fest. Seguiremos melhorando e testando com base no seu feedback. O evento da capa tamb\u00e9m continua!\",null,null,null,\"\u0414\u0435\u043c\u043e\u0432\u0435\u0440\u0441\u0456\u044f \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0449\u0435 \u0434\u0432\u0430 \u0442\u0438\u0436\u043d\u0456 \u043f\u0456\u0441\u043b\u044f Steam Next Fest. \u041c\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0434\u043e\u0432\u0436\u0438\u043c\u043e \u0432\u0434\u043e\u0441\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0430\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0439 \u0442\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f \u0437 \u0443\u0440\u0430\u0445\u0443\u0432\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044f\u043c \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u0432\u0456\u0434\u0433\u0443\u043a\u0456\u0432. \u0410\u043a\u0446\u0456\u044f \u0437 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449\u0435\u043c \u0442\u0430\u043a\u043e\u0436 \u0442\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u0454!\",null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"e46895ffde0a4ddb873f02bfe4bdaaeeb67a0082.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"05dc442756c42e3f727619120b150a2eb9c97ae5.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"677387230220655034","clanid":"46329996","posterid":"0","headline":"The SLAM TANK Demo Is Staying for Two More Weeks!","posttime":1793032234,"updatetime":1793033489,"body":"Thanks to your support, [b]we're extending the demo's availability by two weeks[\/b] so more people can play and share their feedback. The demo will remain available until [b]November 9, 2026 at 17:00 UTC[\/b]. [b]You can still qualify for the cape reward during the extended period.[\/b]\n\nThank you to everyone who played SLAM TANK and cheered us on during Steam Next Fest!\n\n[h2]Two weeks of improvements and testing[\/h2]\n\nOver the next two weeks, we'll continue making improvements and testing based on the feedback you've shared. Whether you're trying the demo for the first time or returning to see what's changed, we'd love to hear from you.\n\nWe'll share updates about these improvements in the comments on this announcement or in patch notes. Please keep letting us know what you think!\n\n[h2]Cape reward details[\/h2]\n\n[b]As previously announced, play the demo for at least 20 minutes or complete it to qualify.[\/b] The full game is required to use the cape; we will share reward delivery details later.\n\nThank you for helping us shape SLAM TANK. We look forward to hearing more from you!\n\nSLAM TANK Team \/ Next Stage Inc.","commentcount":2,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1793032848_0","ModAct_1889321037_1793034238_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"568175240219465822","event_gid":"677387230220655033","voteupcount":42,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1793032200,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"568175240219465822","rtime32_last_modified":1793260736,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1793034239,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1793016765,"votes_up":42,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"582809397049390666","gidfeature2":"568175240219465822"},{"gid":"677387230220654478","clan_steamid":"103582791475851404","event_name":"Demo added to libraries over 50,000 times! A cape gift to say thank you","event_type":28,"appid":5186030,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792947840,"rtime32_end_time":1792951440,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Thanks for over 50,000 demo library adds! We plan to give a cosmetic cape for the full game to players who play the demo for at least 20 minutes or complete it.\",\"Demo \u00fcber 50.000 Mal zur Bibliothek hinzugef\u00fcgt! Wir planen, allen einen Umhang f\u00fcrs Hauptspiel zu schenken, die die Demo mindestens 20 Minuten spielen oder abschlie\u00dfen.\",\"Merci pour plus de 50 000 ajouts aux biblioth\u00e8ques ! Nous pr\u00e9voyons d\u2019offrir une cape pour le jeu complet \u00e0 ceux qui jouent \u00e0 la d\u00e9mo au moins 20 min ou la terminent.\",null,\"\ub370\ubaa8 \ub77c\uc774\ube0c\ub7ec\ub9ac \ucd94\uac00 5\ub9cc \uac74 \ub3cc\ud30c\uc5d0 \uac10\uc0ac\ub4dc\ub9ac\uba70, 20\ubd84 \uc774\uc0c1 \ud50c\ub808\uc774\ud558\uac70\ub098 \ub370\ubaa8\ub97c \ud074\ub9ac\uc5b4\ud55c \ubd84\ub4e4\uaed8 \ubcf8\ud3b8 \ucee4\uc2a4\ud130\ub9c8\uc774\uc9d5 \ub9dd\ud1a0\ub97c \ub4dc\ub9b4 \uc608\uc815\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"\u00a1Gracias por a\u00f1adir la demo a bibliotecas m\u00e1s de 50 000 veces! Planeamos regalar una capa para el juego completo a quienes jueguen la demo al menos 20 minutos o la completen.\",\"\u611f\u8c22\u5927\u5bb6\u8ba9\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u6dfb\u52a0\u81f3\u5e93\u7684\u6b21\u6570\u7a81\u78345\u4e07\uff01\u6211\u4eec\u8ba1\u5212\u5411\u6e38\u73a9\u81f3\u5c1120\u5206\u949f\u6216\u901a\u5173\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\uff0c\u8d60\u9001\u53ef\u5728\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u4e2d\u4f7f\u7528\u7684\u5916\u89c2\u5b9a\u5236\u9053\u5177\u2014\u2014\u62ab\u98ce\u3002\",\"\u611f\u8b1d\u5927\u5bb6\u8b93\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u52a0\u5165\u6536\u85cf\u5eab\u7684\u6b21\u6578\u7a81\u78345\u842c\uff01\u6211\u5011\u9810\u8a08\u5411\u904a\u73a9\u81f3\u5c1120\u5206\u9418\u6216\u901a\u95dc\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u7684\u73a9\u5bb6\uff0c\u8d08\u9001\u53ef\u5728\u6b63\u5f0f\u7248\u4e2d\u4f7f\u7528\u7684\u5916\u89c0\u81ea\u8a02\u9053\u5177\u2014\u2014\u62ab\u98a8\u3002\",\"\u0421\u043f\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0431\u043e \u0437\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 50 000 \u0434\u043e\u0431\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e \u0432 \u0431\u0438\u0431\u043b\u0438\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043a\u0438! \u041f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438\u0440\u0443\u0435\u043c \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0438\u0442\u044c \u043a\u043e\u0441\u043c\u0435\u0442\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u043b\u043d\u043e\u0439 \u0438\u0433\u0440\u044b \u0442\u0435\u043c, \u043a\u0442\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0438\u0433\u0440\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e \u043d\u0435 \u043c\u0435\u043d\u044c\u0448\u0435 20 \u043c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0442 \u0438\u043b\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0434\u0451\u0442 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e.\",null,\"\u4f53\u9a13\u7248\u306e\u30e9\u30a4\u30d6\u30e9\u30ea\u8ffd\u52a05\u4e07\u4ef6\u7a81\u7834\u3078\u306e\u611f\u8b1d\u3092\u8fbc\u3081\u3066\u300120\u5206\u4ee5\u4e0a\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3059\u308b\u304b\u3001\u4f53\u9a13\u7248\u3092\u30af\u30ea\u30a2\u3057\u305f\u65b9\u306b\u3001\u88fd\u54c1\u7248\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u30ab\u30b9\u30bf\u30de\u30a4\u30ba\u7528\u30de\u30f3\u30c8\u3092\u30d7\u30ec\u30bc\u30f3\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u4e88\u5b9a\u3067\u3059\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Obrigado por mais de 50 mil adi\u00e7\u00f5es da demo \u00e0s bibliotecas! Planejamos dar uma capa cosm\u00e9tica para o jogo completo a quem jogar a demo por pelo menos 20 minutos ou conclu\u00ed-la.\",null,null,null,\"\u0414\u044f\u043a\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e \u0437\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0434 50 000 \u0434\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0432\u0430\u043d\u044c \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e \u0434\u043e \u0431\u0456\u0431\u043b\u0456\u043e\u0442\u0435\u043a! \u041f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0443\u0454\u043c\u043e \u043f\u043e\u0434\u0430\u0440\u0443\u0432\u0430\u0442\u0438 \u0434\u0435\u043a\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u0432\u043d\u0438\u0439 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0449 \u0434\u043b\u044f \u043f\u043e\u0432\u043d\u043e\u0457 \u0433\u0440\u0438 \u0442\u0438\u043c, \u0445\u0442\u043e \u0433\u0440\u0430\u0442\u0438\u043c\u0435 \u0432 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e \u0449\u043e\u043d\u0430\u0439\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0448\u0435 20 \u0445\u0432\u0438\u043b\u0438\u043d \u0430\u0431\u043e \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0439\u0434\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e.\",null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"7e6f31be624a41d8d7603c790160b6b179fb9146.png\",\"f629846c39225030f627f43263b9ac7bf216a2c8.png\",\"8b2347b8acff661bb3d62546467cb75a341386b8.png\",null,\"36e70ca993c34bc0dd662c906412ee5ab3d28067.png\",\"824e82e5c87a881e6d643e8cb6d77b258587214c.png\",\"3220c3db68b1980e05f692d9d55fde05740c7514.png\",\"c8b518cbd81285fa2d0870006be1cf4af148cde8.png\",\"4d073c85ae6ac37332bbb471df4f221d27f1d22d.png\",null,\"bf7dca677421d78f835e37ae2bcf9840831b7255.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"a829e9513b9aed875eafc5e6d5db314011fb11d2.png\",null,null,null,\"e221b25b49aa8ef5b0b2e6ee9ede0dec1aff3622.png\",null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"677387230220654479","clanid":"46329996","posterid":"0","headline":"Demo added to libraries over 50,000 times! A cape gift to say thank you","posttime":1792947943,"updatetime":1792947943,"body":"The SLAM TANK demo has been added to Steam libraries over 50,000 times! A heartfelt thank you to everyone who's joined us.\n\nTo thank you for your support, we're preparing an event where you can receive a [b]cosmetic cape to customize your tank in the full game[\/b] as a gift.\n\nThe dates shown on the cover image are the dates of Steam Next Fest. We'll announce the participation period for our cape thank-you event and how the reward will be distributed at a later date.\n\n[img]https:\/\/clan.fastly.steamstatic.com\/images\/46617819\/2ce4602625f7284311fb4824377e78e70dcb8022.png[\/img]\n\nMake your tank your own in the full game with this red cape featuring gold patterns.\n\n[looping_media webm=\"https:\/\/shared.fastly.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321770\/extras\/a553a44f1fd6f72a0952d8d248e077ac.webm?t=1791004132\"][\/looping_media]\n\n[looping_media webm=\"https:\/\/shared.fastly.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5321770\/extras\/e660027c08a9c7eaa6a70e8b9f3c67b1.webm?t=1791004132\"][\/looping_media]\n\nThe images and videos show the game in its current state of development. We plan to make further improvements for the final version.\n\nWe plan to give the cape to players who [b]meet one of the following conditions[\/b]:\n\n[list]\n[*]Play the demo [b]for at least 20 minutes[\/b]\n[*][b]Complete the demo[\/b]\n[\/list]\n\nThe full game is required to use the cape.\n\nWe'll announce event dates, detailed participation requirements, and when and how to claim the reward at a later date.\n\nThank you for your interest and participation!","commentcount":2,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1792950595_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"568175240219360887","event_gid":"677387230220654478","voteupcount":43,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"568175240219360887","rtime32_last_modified":1793310212,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792950596,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792947709,"votes_up":43,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"582809397049390666","gidfeature2":"568175240219360887"},{"gid":"677387230220653180","clan_steamid":"103582791475851404","event_name":"SLAM TANK \u2014 Steam Next Fest Day 3 Patch Notes","event_type":13,"appid":5186030,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792675680,"rtime32_end_time":1792679401,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Skill input fixes, clearer prompts, and visual updates\",null,null,null,\"\\uc2a4\\ud0ac \\uc785\\ub825\\uacfc \\ubc84\\ud2bc \\uc548\\ub0b4, \\ud654\\uba74 \\ud45c\\ud604 \\uac1c\\uc120\",null,\"\\u6280\\u80fd\\u8f93\\u5165\\u3001\\u6309\\u952e\\u63d0\\u793a\\u4e0e\\u753b\\u9762\\u8868\\u73b0\\u6539\\u8fdb\",\"\\u6280\\u80fd\\u8f38\\u5165\\u3001\\u6309\\u9375\\u63d0\\u793a\\u8207\\u756b\\u9762\\u5448\\u73fe\\u6539\\u5584\",null,null,\"\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30eb\\u5165\\u529b\\u3001\\u30dc\\u30bf\\u30f3\\u8868\\u793a\\u3001\\u753b\\u9762\\u8868\\u73fe\\u3092\\u6539\\u5584\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"Our Day 3 notes collect improvements added since the Day 1 announcement: skill input and controller prompt fixes, clearer guides, visual fixes, and lighting effects.\",null,null,null,\"Day 3\\uc5d0\\ub294 Day 1 \\uacf5\\uc9c0 \\uc774\\ud6c4 \\ub370\\ubaa8\\uc5d0 \\ubc18\\uc601\\ud55c \\uac1c\\uc120\\uc0ac\\ud56d\\uc744 \\ubaa8\\uc544 \\uc548\\ub0b4\\ud569\\ub2c8\\ub2e4. \\uc2a4\\ud0ac \\uc785\\ub825\\uacfc \\ucee8\\ud2b8\\ub864\\ub7ec \\uc548\\ub0b4 \\uc218\\uc815, \\ub3c4\\uc6c0\\ub9d0 \\ubcf4\\uac15, \\ud654\\uba74 \\ud45c\\uc2dc \\uc624\\ub958 \\uc218\\uc815\\uacfc \\uc870\\uba85 \\ud6a8\\uacfc \\ucd94\\uac00\\uac00 \\ud3ec\\ud568\\ub429\\ub2c8\\ub2e4.\",null,\"Day 3 \\u66f4\\u65b0\\u65e5\\u5fd7\\u6c47\\u603b\\u4e86 Day 1 \\u516c\\u544a\\u4e4b\\u540e\\u5df2\\u52a0\\u5165\\u8bd5\\u73a9\\u7248\\u7684\\u6539\\u8fdb\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u6280\\u80fd\\u8f93\\u5165\\u4e0e\\u624b\\u67c4\\u63d0\\u793a\\u4fee\\u590d\\u3001\\u5e2e\\u52a9\\u8bf4\\u660e\\u8865\\u5145\\u3001\\u753b\\u9762\\u663e\\u793a\\u4fee\\u590d\\u548c\\u706f\\u5149\\u6548\\u679c\\u65b0\\u589e\\u3002\",\"Day 3 \\u66f4\\u65b0\\u8aaa\\u660e\\u5f59\\u6574\\u4e86 Day 1 \\u516c\\u544a\\u4e4b\\u5f8c\\u5df2\\u52a0\\u5165\\u8a66\\u73a9\\u7248\\u7684\\u6539\\u5584\\uff0c\\u5305\\u62ec\\u6280\\u80fd\\u8f38\\u5165\\u8207\\u624b\\u628a\\u63d0\\u793a\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u3001\\u64cd\\u4f5c\\u8aaa\\u660e\\u88dc\\u5145\\u3001\\u756b\\u9762\\u986f\\u793a\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u53ca\\u71c8\\u5149\\u6548\\u679c\\u65b0\\u589e\\u3002\",null,null,\"Day 3\\u3067\\u306f\\u3001Day 1\\u306e\\u304a\\u77e5\\u3089\\u305b\\u4ee5\\u964d\\u306b\\u4f53\\u9a13\\u7248\\u3078\\u53cd\\u6620\\u3057\\u305f\\u6539\\u5584\\u70b9\\u3092\\u307e\\u3068\\u3081\\u3066\\u3054\\u7d39\\u4ecb\\u3057\\u307e\\u3059\\u3002\\u30b9\\u30ad\\u30eb\\u5165\\u529b\\u3068\\u30dc\\u30bf\\u30f3\\u8868\\u793a\\u306e\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u3001\\u64cd\\u4f5c\\u6848\\u5185\\u306e\\u5145\\u5b9f\\u3001\\u8868\\u793a\\u4e0d\\u5177\\u5408\\u306e\\u4fee\\u6b63\\u3001\\u7167\\u660e\\u30a8\\u30d5\\u30a7\\u30af\\u30c8\\u306e\\u8ffd\\u52a0\\u304c\\u542b\\u307e\\u308c\\u307e\\u3059\\u3002\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"3c0a22ad94e8f4969fbc6a87da083d575d4ab79e.png\",null,null,null,\"a9fe5afaf89503ea2e1c23df8a3fc0c2ac4948e5.png\",null,\"088f57d37d456de874d1d98000701df59abfae7a.png\",\"c00fafbc376c570845fde2f21e06c1268f36200e.png\",null,null,\"d09468e54e5c865f1d7cb8460e02df11c5c03b3c.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"clone_from_event_gid\":\"671757096278035812\",\"clone_from_sale_enabled\":false}","announcement_body":{"gid":"677387230220653181","clanid":"46329996","posterid":"0","headline":"SLAM TANK \u2014 Steam Next Fest Day 3 Patch Notes","posttime":1792675767,"updatetime":1792675767,"body":"[img]https:\/\/clan.fastly.steamstatic.com\/images\/46329996\/3c0a22ad94e8f4969fbc6a87da083d575d4ab79e.png[\/img]\n\nHello from the SLAM TANK team!\n\nThank you for playing the demo and sharing your thoughts with us on the third day of Steam Next Fest!\n\nToday, we're rounding up the improvements added to the demo since our Day 1 announcement. These include fixes for skill input and controller button prompts, clearer control guides, visual fixes for parts of the scenery and effects, and new lighting effects in the main level.\n\n[h2]Skill inputs and controller prompts[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Fixed an issue where skills could fail to activate with LB + skill button on gamepad after being stunned by a Cargo Runner's electric attack.\n[*]Fixed an issue where holding a skill button caused the skill to activate again as soon as it ended. Skills now activate once per button press.\n[*]Fixed an issue where button prompts could switch between PlayStation and Xbox icons with each button press while using a DualSense controller.\n[*]Improved DualShock 4 detection so PlayStation button prompts display correctly and vibration works properly.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Clearer control guides[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Added button icons to the Light Attack, Strong Attack, and Combo Attack guides, with labels showing whether each input is used on the ground or in the air.\n[*]Updated the skill gauge item instructions in the help guide to show the button icon for your current input device.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Visual fixes and lighting effects[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Fixed unwanted transparency on some floors and building walls.\n[*]Fixed an issue where debris effects from cargo transport equipment could incorrectly overlap the tank.\n[*]Added lens flare effects to floodlights and lighting towers in the main level.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Keep sharing your thoughts[\/h2]\nIf something feels uncomfortable to play or a control guide could be clearer, let us know through the in-demo feedback page or on the [url=https:\/\/steamcommunity.com\/app\/5186030\/discussions\/]Steam discussion board[\/url]. We'll keep reading your feedback and making improvements.\n\nThank you for playing!\n\nSLAM TANK Team \/ Next Stage Inc.","commentcount":2,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1847323374_1792676466_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174939259158887","event_gid":"677387230220653180","voteupcount":34,"votedowncount":4,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"568174939259158887","rtime32_last_modified":1793145499,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792676466,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792675721,"votes_up":34,"votes_down":4,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"582809397049390666","gidfeature2":"568174939259158887"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["677387230220655034","677387230220654479"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1792675680,"event_gid":"677387230220653180","announcement_gid":"677387230220653181","clan_account_id":46329996}}};
