											<div class="game_area_sys_req_leftCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1660 6 GB or AMD Radeon RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Some visual effects are limited on GPUs without hardware ray tracing support.</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
																<div class="game_area_sys_req_rightCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-9700 or AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 12 GB or AMD Radeon RX 6700 XT 12 GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD recommended. To experience the full intended visual quality, please use a GPU that supports hardware ray tracing.</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
